# Agent workflow

Use `/wiki/Agent-Orchestration.md` and `/wiki/Agent-Build-Plan.md`.

Every task needs a bounded contract before implementation. Store it in the issue/task system or under `.cursor/plans/`. Use branch/worktree `agent/<nn>-<slug>`. Do not overlap write scopes with another agent.

Before claiming completion:

- run the task's tests;
- run applicable leakage/regression checks;
- update relevant wiki/contracts;
- report exact files changed and metrics before/after;
- note limitations and follow-up work.

Agent 00 is the Watcher. Treat Watcher correction prompts as blocking review feedback. Do not work around a rejection by weakening tests or changing benchmark definitions.

Prefer small mergeable increments over giant rewrites. Shared schemas have one owner per batch.

`main` is the only durable integrated product branch. A task is not delivered merely because it exists on an agent or integration branch.
